  "description": {
   "en": "A girl who supports her best friend's love, Kawarime-san. She watches over her best friend from the shadows, hoping that his confession goes well, but due to an unexpected turn of events, she ends up being the one to confess…\n\nShe watches a turning point in her life. A slapstick cross-purposes romcom.\n\n**Note:** Also includes the short romcom *Cunning Kosaka-san*!\n___\n**Buy:**\n- [Melonbooks](https://www.melonbooks.co.jp/detail/detail.php?product_id=2089781)\n- [Suruga-ya](https://www.suruga-ya.jp/product/detail/ZHORO80926)",
   "ja": "親友の恋を応援している女の子。(かわりめ)変目さん。\n彼女は親友の告白がうまく行くように影ながら見守っているが、\nひょんな事から自分が告白する側に回ってしまって…。\n\n彼女が見守る人生の変わり目。\nそんな彼女のドタバタすれ違いラブコメ。\n※短編ラブコメ『こざかしい小坂さん』も収録!"
  },
